  {"id": "seed.flagship.p.3", "page": "seed", "section": "flagship", "label": "Paragraph 3", "kind": "text", "default": "The model assumes {visits} paid visits per day at established trade. To test that assumption, estimate visits from foot traffic and observed conversion by daypart, then check spend and venue capacity at each candidate site."},
